A||||59||GT Bastard||What's a good place to live in the US?||||3||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||01-26-2001||11:33 PM||||I've been thinking about moving somewhere else.  I'd like to be a little warmer in winter.  I'd also like to be in a place with beautiful scenery and a lots to do.  So who enjoys their State/City?  How bout jobs?  I'd like to get into an IT job, because it's really all that I know(aside from sarcasm.)||||reg||3
