Z||000021||mrfiero||01-28-2001||11:36 PM||||Come on down here to Denver.  There are plenty of IT jobs in the area and the weather is incredible.  Yes, we get snow in the winter, but not as much as many people think.  The good part is NO humidity!!  It can be 100* outside, but feels good (you hardly sweat).  That low humidity translates into NO rust issues......I can disassemble a Fiero with hand tools (no broken exhaust bolts either!).   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I have lived here since '84 and have tried moving away.....everytime I move back.  No other place compares to Colorado.  Our economy is rock solid, we have all major sports represented, the weather is great, lots to see & do and most importantly......you can help me strip Fieros!!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>Seriously.....if you are serious about moving, look into Colorado. <p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 01-28-2001).]||||reg||10
