Z||000032||Black88GT||01-30-2001||11:30 AM||||I don't like Baltimore that much at all.  The only thing going for us is that we are the home of the <B>SUPER BOWL CHAMPS!!</B> YEAH BABY!!<P>Other then that, it kinda sucks.  Way to many liberals.  Home of the NAACP, makes everyone in high places afraid to do anything not "politically correct" therefore nothing gets done.  Our gun grabbing Governor is horrible, and he stole the election a couple years back.  We have 2 senators who don't do anything at all, Sarbanes is a figurehead in the Democratic party and Mikulski only opens her mouth when the camera is on.  They have been fixing up downtown Baltimore though.  It used to be the pits.  Now we have ESPN Zone, Hard Rock, Harbor Place (really nice), The Aquarium, Camden Yards where the O's play and PSI Net where the <B>SUPER BOWL CHAMPS</B>  play.  We do have Johns Hopkins too which is a good school/hospital.  Traffic has gotten much worse though ever since people started fleeing the city to go into the county.  695 Used to be nice and pleasant, now, no matter what time of day it is, it's packed. <P>So all in all, I guess its not that bad, since we are the home of the <B>SUPER BOWL CHAMPS</B>, but when I go into the Air Force I will look forward to seeing other places.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||4
